WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:08.592
Hi! Now we train for the Goethe-Zertifikat A1 exam.

2
00:00:08.992 --> 00:00:12.432
Today: listening and reading.

3
00:00:14.133 --> 00:00:17.189
The exam has four parts:

4
00:00:17.589 --> 00:00:21.437
Listening: about twenty minutes.

5
00:00:21.837 --> 00:00:26.261
Reading: about twenty-five minutes.

6
00:00:26.661 --> 00:00:30.653
Writing: about twenty minutes.

7
00:00:31.053 --> 00:00:36.317
Speaking: about fifteen minutes, in a group.

8
00:00:38.033 --> 00:00:41.329
The most important tip for listening:

9
00:00:41.729 --> 00:00:47.929
Read the task first. Then you know what to listen for.

10
00:00:49.633 --> 00:00:52.569
Listening has three parts:

11
00:00:52.969 --> 00:00:58.857
Part one: short conversations. You hear them twice.

12
00:00:59.257 --> 00:01:04.785
Part two: announcements. You hear them only once!

13
00:01:05.185 --> 00:01:10.929
Part three: phone messages. Twice.

14
00:01:12.633 --> 00:01:15.905
Reading also has three parts:

15
00:01:16.305 --> 00:01:21.401
Part one: short texts, for example emails.

16
00:01:21.801 --> 00:01:28.169
Part two: adverts. Which fits, a or b?

17
00:01:28.569 --> 00:01:32.321
Part three: signs and notices.

18
00:01:34.033 --> 00:01:41.745
Pay special attention to numbers, times and places. They're almost always important!

19
00:01:42.145 --> 00:01:45.705
Numbers, times, places.

20
00:01:47.400 --> 00:01:59.048
Now you! Listen and answer: the train to Bremen leaves today at 14:30 from platform seven. When does the train leave?

21
00:02:06.733 --> 00:02:10.869
Great! Now you can:

22
00:02:11.269 --> 00:02:18.069
You know the listening and reading parts of the exam. And you have good tips!

23
00:02:18.469 --> 00:02:20.589
See you soon!
